    "body": "**Issue type:**\r\n\r\n[x] question\r\n[ ] bug report\r\n[ ] feature request\r\n[ ] documentation issue\r\n\r\n**Database system/driver:**\r\n\r\n[ ] `cordova`\r\n[x] `mongodb`\r\n[ ] `mssql`\r\n[x] `mysql` / `mariadb`\r\n[ ] `oracle`\r\n[ ] `postgres`\r\n[ ] `sqlite`\r\n[ ] `sqljs`\r\n[ ] `websql`\r\n\r\n**TypeORM version:**\r\n\r\n[x] `latest`\r\n[ ] `@next`\r\n[ ] `0.x.x` (or put your version here)\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce or a small repository showing the problem:**\r\n\r\n I am working with 2 connections: mysql and mongodb. My listeners are triggered only by the mysql operations: insert, update etc. but mongodb is not triggering any listeners. My mongodb version is ```mongodb: ^2.2.33```\r\n\r\n```\r\n@EventSubscriber()\r\nexport class EntitySubscriber implements EntitySubscriberInterface {\r\n\r\n  public beforeInsert(event: InsertEvent<any>) {\r\n    console.log('*before insert', event.entity)\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  public beforeUpdate(event: UpdateEvent<any>) {\r\n    console.log('*before update', event.entity)\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  public beforeRemove(event: RemoveEvent<any>) {\r\n    console.log('*before remove', event.entity)\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nI also have entity listeners inside the entity classes, which does not trigger too.\r\n```\r\n\r\n@Entity('componentsContent')\r\nexport class ComponentContent extends BaseEntity {\r\n\r\n  @ObjectIdColumn()\r\n  public id: ObjectID\r\n\r\n  @Column('json')\r\n  public content: any\r\n\r\n  @CreateDateColumn()\r\n  public createdAt: Date\r\n\r\n  @UpdateDateColumn()\r\n  public updatedAt: Date\r\n\r\n  @VersionColumn()\r\n  public version: number\r\n\r\n  @AfterUpdate()\r\n  public updated() {\r\n    console.log(\"updated\")\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @AfterInsert()\r\n  public inserted() {\r\n    console.log(\"inserted\")\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  @AfterLoad()\r\n  public loaded() {\r\n    console.log('loaded')\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe subscriber class is registered in the ormconfig:\r\n```\r\nsubscribers: [\r\n    EntitySubscriber\r\n  ]\r\n```\r\n\r\nDo I need any specific version of mongo ? Or I am missing something ?\r\n\r\nThank you!\r\n\r\n",
